      "text": "The old Browntail manor explodes, its walls torn apart like cardboard.\nGlass and wood fragments fly in all directions, as flames consume the traces of a once sumptuous history. The boiling smoke distorts the night air.\nThe Paleroche warriors stand transfixed, eyes wide. Behind the brown car, some warriors caught by the blast now stagger as they try to help each other up.\nThe echoes of the explosion gradually disperse, leaving the crackle of wood and distant sirens ever clearer in the night.\nA charred jacket drifts down in front of Arctosz."
